; Sample EDN from draft-ietf-cbor-edn-literals-23 (raw strings)

; Simple raw string (equal delimiters)
``[^ \t\n\r"'`]``

; Inner double-backticks need triple delimiters
```To emulate typographic quotes, sometimes duplicate backward and
forward single quotes are used, as in ``text.''
```

; Leading backquote via swallowed newline after open
```a```

; Excess closing backticks become content (§2.5.3)
```a = ``foo`````

